## 4. Important Tailwind CSS Classes

| Class               | Purpose                     |
| ------------------- | --------------------------- |
| `text-center`       | Aligns text to the center   |
| `text-red-500`      | Sets text color to red      |
| `text-3xl`          | Sets large text size        |
| `font-bold`         | Makes text bold             |
| `bg-blue-500`       | Sets background color       |
| `p-4`               | Adds padding                |
| `m-4`               | Adds margin                 |
| `mt-5`              | Adds top margin             |
| `rounded-lg`        | Adds rounded corners        |
| `flex`              | Enables Flexbox             |
| `justify-center`    | Centers items horizontally  |
| `items-center`      | Aligns items vertically     |
| `hover:bg-blue-700` | Changes background on hover |

